              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Unarmed mahout and up to five crew armed with javelins at +6 pts per model. The crew may have light armour (+2 pts), thrusting spears or shields (+1 pt). One elephant per 1,000 points in the army. (Armies of Antiquity p.27)</characteristic>
