            </profile>
            <profile id="e209-1779-a71d-8e17" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="aab0-aa1e-0319-4ffe" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Crew of two to five men armed with swords. May have light armour (+2 pts per crewman). Bolt thrower: Range 48", Strength 5 (-1 per rank), no save, D4 wounds per hit. No more than one artillery piece per infantry unit in the army (not enforced). One artillery piece per 500 points. (Armies of Antiquity p.27)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
